  "visual_review": "Film 864x480, 90.00 s, 13 scenes: ruined neon street -> house -> rooms with peeling walls -> PC room -> rooftop over the skyline -> short return to the room -> rooftop finale over the dystopian city at dawn. Singer from the character sheet stays recognisable (blonde hair with pink ends, black/pink panda-print outfit, choker) across all scenes; singing close-ups follow the song. Worst seam (scene 1->2, ratio 1.74) inspected frame by frame: same framing, subject and street, mild detail step from the VAE round trip of the frozen frames during a fast singing close-up. Weak points: oversized panda holograms in the street scenes (from the LLM location text), occasional fishnet/extra accessories.",
